Title: Request for GovRAMP In-Scope Production Cloud Account and Application Inventory

Content:
Hi Team,

As part of our ongoing GovRAMP Moderate POA&M development activities, I would like to request an inventory of all production cloud accounts currently onboarded into Wiz that fall within the GovRAMP authorization boundary.

Specifically, it would be helpful to obtain the following information:

Cloud Account Inventory: A list of all in-scope production cloud accounts across AWS, Azure, and GCP, including account names, account/subscription/project IDs, and associated cloud providers.

Application Mapping: If available, a list of applications or services associated with each cloud account, including their respective application owners or responsible teams.

Onboarding and Coverage Status: Confirmation of whether each identified account is actively onboarded into Wiz and included in the applicable vulnerability and compliance scanning activities.

This information is needed to validate the completeness and accuracy of our GovRAMP asset inventory and ensure that all applicable cloud resources are appropriately accounted for in our POA&M reporting and remediation tracking.

If an existing Wiz inventory report or export contains this information, please feel free to share it in Excel or CSV format.

Thank you for your support. Please let me know if any clarification is needed.

Best regards,
